            <title>[BOOKKEEPER-427] TestConcurrentTopicAcquisition hangs every so often</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-427</link>
                <project id="12311293" key="BOOKKEEPER">Bookkeeper</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;I&apos;m seeing this test hang every so often. To repro:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;while&lt;/span&gt; [ $? = 0 ]; &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;do&lt;/span&gt; mvn test -Dtest=TestConcurrentTopicAcquisition; done
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
