                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="13481473" author="ikelly" created="Mon, 22 Oct 2012 16:19:36 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;patch fixes a npe in the subscriber response handler, which was causing a clients callback to never be called. it triggered when the subscription info had not been set when a disconnection event occurred. this can happen if the channel is disconnected before the subscription reqesu is successful.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13481930" author="hustlmsp" created="Mon, 22 Oct 2012 23:33:42 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;good catch, thanks Ivan. +1 for the patch.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13482313" author="ikelly" created="Tue, 23 Oct 2012 13:24:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Committed as r1401286. Thanks for reviewing Sijie&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
